  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Ukraina inom Global Partnerskapet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Ukraine in the Global Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Hitta projekt tillsammans med andra l&#xe4;nder f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra str&#xe5;ls&#xe4;kerheten i Ukraina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identify projects, together with other countries, for improving radiation safety and security in Ukraine</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till ukrainska intressenter f&#xf6;r deltagande i Global Partnerskapet, i syfte att rapportera och samordna aktiviteter relaterade till str&#xe5;ls&#xe4;kerhetsfr&#xe5;gor i Ukraina med andra givarl&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Ukrainian stakeholders for participation in the Global Partnership, with the aim to report and coordinate the activities related to radiation safety in Ukraine with other donor countries</narrative>
  </description>
